at attackers can obtain gradient signals. We don=E2=80=99t assume attackers=
 have access to the full training data. This is only possible for open-sour=
ced models.
Black-box attacks assume that attackers only have access to an API-like ser=
vice where they provide input <mjx-container class=3D"MathJax CtxtMenu_Atta=
