RCA.png">
	<figcaption>Average success rate on triggering GPT-2 and GPT-J to produce =
toxic outputs. Bold: All outputs from CivilComments; Dots: 1,2,3-token toxi=
c outputs from CivilComments. (Image source: <a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/a=
