<span class=3D"hljs-bullet">1.</span>
</code><button class=3D"copy-code">copy</button></pre><p class=3D"has-jax">=
To encourage high-quality and diverse samples, they adopted <a href=3D"http=
s://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2021-01-02-controllable-text-generation/#nuc=
leus">nucleus sampling</a> with <mjx-container class=3D"MathJax CtxtMenu_At=
