xplore-establish-exploit.png">
	<figcaption>The pipeline of red-teaming via Explore-Establish-Exploit step=
s. (Image source: <a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.09442" target=3D"_b=
lank">Casper et al. 2023</a>)</figcaption>
</figure>
