int problem in the lens of robust optimization (<a href=3D"https://arxiv.or=
g/abs/1706.06083">Madry et al. 2017</a> ). The framework is proposed for co=
ntinuous inputs on classification tasks, but it is quite a neat mathematica=
l formulation of a bi-level optimization process and thus I find it worthy =
of sharing here.</p>
